{'symbol': 'SJM', 'date': '2021-12-01 17:15:00', 'title': 'THE J.M. SMUCKER CO. DIVESTS PRIVATE LABEL DRY PET FOOD BUSINESS AS PART OF CONTINUED PORTFOLIO OPTIMIZATION', 'text': 'ORRVILLE, OHIO, DEC. 1,\xa02021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE J.M. SMUCKER CO.\xa0(NYSE: SJM)\xa0ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS SOLD ITS\xa0PRIVATE LABEL DRY PET FOOD BUSINESS, INCLUDING ITS MANUFACTURING FACILITY IN FRONTENAC, KANSAS, TO DIAMOND PET FOODS, INC., IN A CASH TRANSACTION VALUED AT\xa0APPROXIMATELY\xa0$33 MILLION.'}